+
+What the migration deletes in the development database (measured on a copy):
+comments 14 (+14 translations), votes 56, taggings 18, follows 12, flags 2,
+notifications 5, activities 2, related contents 2 (+2 scores), communities 12
+(+1 topic), map locations 2, settings 17, web sections 1, and the dashboard
