+* Nothing else is planned: the removal is finished once this deploy is out.
+
+### Left as is, on purpose
+
+* Tags that were only used by citizen proposals stay (with 0 taggings); tags
+  are shared and administrators may still use them as categories.
+* Users that authored proposals stay (they're citizens).
+* Newsletters and admin notifications sent to the removed segments
